cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NPDM Explorer or its dataset in research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "NPDM Explorer"
abstract: >-
  An offline browser for Switch 2 NPDM metadata and the IPC service graph.
  The dataset covers 64 installed full SystemProgram titles from a community
  firmware 23.0.1 dump. The project is independent research and is not
  affiliated with Nintendo.
authors:
  - name: "NPDM Explorer contributors"
version: "0.1.5"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tasenjo80/switch2-npdm-explorer"
url: "https://tasenjo80.github.io/switch2-npdm-explorer/"
keywords:
  - nintendo-switch-2
  - npdm
  - homebrew
  - reverse-engineering
  - ipc
  - research
